{
  "id": "c1-e31-transport-of-the-future",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Transport of the future",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you usually get around, and why?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you find most frustrating about travelling in your area?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, would you be willing to change the way you travel for environmental reasons?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you think people will be travelling in twenty years' time?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e31-a1",
            "c1-e31-a2",
            "c1-e31-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different forms of transport. Choose two of the pictures and say what the advantages of these forms of transport might be, and how people might feel about using them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these would you most like to use in the future?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e31-b1",
            "c1-e31-b2",
            "c1-e31-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show transport of people or goods. Choose two of the pictures and say what effect this transport has on the environment, and how it could be improved.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think we should travel less?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some innovations in transport, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e31-transport-of-the-future",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these innovations change the way people live?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e31-transport-of-the-future",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would have the greatest effect on everyday life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about the future of transport.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent should governments invest in new transport technology rather than improving existing services?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you trust a vehicle that drives itself?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is it fair to charge drivers for entering city centres?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Will remote working reduce the need for travel in the long term?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how might the way we plan our cities change if cars were less important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should short flights be banned where there are train alternatives?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e31-transport-of-the-future/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
